{"5031430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "I Buried Steve", "steam_appid": 5031430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5076850], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to a chaotic multiplayer paradise where the sand is warm and the weapons are absurd. Blast your rivals, dodge battleship artillery, and survive the Sharknado!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5031430/extras/843d445fbd1333e5f894734067d45241.poster.avif?t=1788106599\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5031430/extras/843d445fbd1333e5f894734067d45241.webm?t=1788106599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5031430/extras/843d445fbd1333e5f894734067d45241.mp4?t=1788106599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build in Secret. Race in Chaos.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every round starts at the tiki bar. Draft private hazards, fly over the beach, and bury traps in the sand. Nobody sees your creations until the countdown hits zero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then, all eight players sprint at once. Reach the finish line before the rising flood waters wash you away. Score points for sabotaging your friends. Just make sure you do not trip over your own traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5031430/extras/d10c553366fd2d08d53eb50c816f7618.poster.avif?t=1788106599\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5031430/extras/d10c553366fd2d08d53eb50c816f7618.webm?t=1788106599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5031430/extras/d10c553366fd2d08d53eb50c816f7618.mp4?t=1788106599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An Arsenal That Hates You</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the route with 40 build pieces and 14 lethal hazards. Plant spinning blades, swinging axes, and punch blocks to block the path. Use pipes, bounce pads, and portals to build transit loops. Want more chaos? Grab power-ups to fire grapple hooks, throw boomerangs, or use a spade to bury rivals waist-deep in the sand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5031430/extras/41ab438877d415e98119341440bb6789.poster.avif?t=1788106599\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5031430/extras/41ab438877d415e98119341440bb6789.webm?t=1788106599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5031430/extras/41ab438877d415e98119341440bb6789.mp4?t=1788106599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No Two Rounds Are The Same</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A twist is rolled before every build phase. Fight low gravity, skate across slippery black ice, dodge shells from the battleship on the horizon, or run for your life from the Sharknado. The beach you finish on is never the beach you started on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Is In The Box</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8-Player Mayhem:</strong> Backstab friends online or over LAN with built-in proximity voice chat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Couch Co-op:</strong> Share the chaos locally with support for two players per screen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo Time Trials:</strong> Master movement across a 30-star solo campaign or build unrestricted custom maps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earned Cosmetics:</strong> Unlock 36 cosmetic items and use the skin paint tool to stand out.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play The Free Demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo is out now and it is not a thin slice. Every build piece, every power-up, every modifier, the whole tutorial and all of multiplayer are in it. The 30-star solo campaign and the level builder are what you unlock in the full game.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to a chaotic multiplayer paradise where the sand is warm and the weapons are absurd. Blast your rivals, dodge battleship artillery, and survive the Sharknado!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5031430/extras/843d445fbd1333e5f894734067d45241.poster.avif?t=1788106599\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5031430/extras/843d445fbd1333e5f894734067d45241.webm?t=1788106599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5031430/extras/843d445fbd1333e5f894734067d45241.mp4?t=1788106599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build in Secret. Race in Chaos.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every round starts at the tiki bar. Draft private hazards, fly over the beach, and bury traps in the sand. Nobody sees your creations until the countdown hits zero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then, all eight players sprint at once. Reach the finish line before the rising flood waters wash you away. Score points for sabotaging your friends. Just make sure you do not trip over your own traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5031430/extras/d10c553366fd2d08d53eb50c816f7618.poster.avif?t=1788106599\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5031430/extras/d10c553366fd2d08d53eb50c816f7618.webm?t=1788106599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5031430/extras/d10c553366fd2d08d53eb50c816f7618.mp4?t=1788106599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An Arsenal That Hates You</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the route with 40 build pieces and 14 lethal hazards. Plant spinning blades, swinging axes, and punch blocks to block the path. Use pipes, bounce pads, and portals to build transit loops. Want more chaos? Grab power-ups to fire grapple hooks, throw boomerangs, or use a spade to bury rivals waist-deep in the sand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5031430/extras/41ab438877d415e98119341440bb6789.poster.avif?t=1788106599\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5031430/extras/41ab438877d415e98119341440bb6789.webm?t=1788106599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5031430/extras/41ab438877d415e98119341440bb6789.mp4?t=1788106599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No Two Rounds Are The Same</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A twist is rolled before every build phase. Fight low gravity, skate across slippery black ice, dodge shells from the battleship on the horizon, or run for your life from the Sharknado. The beach you finish on is never the beach you started on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Is In The Box</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8-Player Mayhem:</strong> Backstab friends online or over LAN with built-in proximity voice chat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Couch Co-op:</strong> Share the chaos locally with support for two players per screen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo Time Trials:</strong> Master movement across a 30-star solo campaign or build unrestricted custom maps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earned Cosmetics:</strong> Unlock 36 cosmetic items and use the skin paint tool to stand out.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play The Free Demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo is out now and it is not a thin slice. Every build piece, every power-up, every modifier, the whole tutorial and all of multiplayer are in it. The 30-star solo campaign and the level builder are what you unlock in the full game.</p>", "short_description": "A chaotic beach party game for up to 8 players where you build the level as you play. Bury devious hidden traps in the sand, then race your friends through them without sabotaging yourself.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Dutch, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Swedish, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5031430/989fed0296730d54c7251de17189527fb7c37148/header.jpg?t=1788106599", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5031430/83984d5b5f88387b8cbe2db26cc7f421d127b111/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788106599